{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a shifting simulation that feels both tragic and hilarious. Observe, interact, or simply exist as the world reshapes around you \u2014 a meditative, overstimulated reflection on what it means to keep going when everything\u2019s falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/b122c4cfc960ca3e07686a6f1cb126cb.poster.avif?t=1765472835\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/b122c4cfc960ca3e07686a6f1cb126cb.webm?t=1765472835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/b122c4cfc960ca3e07686a6f1cb126cb.mp4?t=1765472835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part video game, part art installation, Sometimes to Deal With the Difficulty of Being Alive\u2026 is an interactive loop of coping mechanisms \u2014 a place where despair and delight blur into the same texture. You\u2019re not given objectives, just a living space that responds to your presence, your stillness, your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/ca8e5bdafe6334e715c04d7b0cc3e71e.poster.avif?t=1765472835\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/ca8e5bdafe6334e715c04d7b0cc3e71e.webm?t=1765472835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/ca8e5bdafe6334e715c04d7b0cc3e71e.mp4?t=1765472835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment feels absurd: NPCs that sing about heartbreak in glitch-voice harmonies, battlefields that double as therapy sessions, color palettes that shift with your emotional temperature. It\u2019s overstimulation as catharsis \u2014 the act of being overwhelmed as a kind of peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, it\u2019s not about survival. It\u2019s about resonance. A digital hum that reminds you you\u2019re still here \u2014 and somehow, that\u2019s enough.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shooter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/789380/9ad0b32065fe536cedf0d869f74d92f3e6bcd07c.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Lair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/789380/3651f5752067d7f11c2b33fad646349183fc67f1.jpg"},{"name":"Two Hours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/789380/7c3243bd52230a9a14f7d952b7df1b6e2ef1d86f.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/789380?t=1765472835","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/d5c5a97d5b28ab232518dddd21da843cc4302af2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765472835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/ffffe45ddc89729021239dc06f16256e5270021b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765472835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/ffffe45ddc89729021239dc06f16256e5270021b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765472835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is some language that might be offensive. There is some talk of sex and drugs."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not for everyone. If you\u2019re looking for some fun, addicting type game with slick mechanics, do not download this. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in single player mode, start a server or join a server. LAN works but usually from the .exe directly rather than from the app inside Steam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by: Glamour Lakes, X-Coast, RipCD</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a shifting simulation that feels both tragic and hilarious. Observe, interact, or simply exist as the world reshapes around you \u2014 a meditative, overstimulated reflection on what it means to keep going when everything\u2019s falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/b122c4cfc960ca3e07686a6f1cb126cb.poster.avif?t=1765472835\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/b122c4cfc960ca3e07686a6f1cb126cb.webm?t=1765472835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/b122c4cfc960ca3e07686a6f1cb126cb.mp4?t=1765472835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part video game, part art installation, Sometimes to Deal With the Difficulty of Being Alive\u2026 is an interactive loop of coping mechanisms \u2014 a place where despair and delight blur into the same texture. You\u2019re not given objectives, just a living space that responds to your presence, your stillness, your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/ca8e5bdafe6334e715c04d7b0cc3e71e.poster.avif?t=1765472835\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/ca8e5bdafe6334e715c04d7b0cc3e71e.webm?t=1765472835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/extras/ca8e5bdafe6334e715c04d7b0cc3e71e.mp4?t=1765472835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment feels absurd: NPCs that sing about heartbreak in glitch-voice harmonies, battlefields that double as therapy sessions, color palettes that shift with your emotional temperature. It\u2019s overstimulation as catharsis \u2014 the act of being overwhelmed as a kind of peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, it\u2019s not about survival. It\u2019s about resonance. A digital hum that reminds you you\u2019re still here \u2014 and somehow, that\u2019s enough.</p>","developers":["Jeremy Couillard","Ireneo Mercado"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/789380/735ecead0b563fc2d7e8dba0cdcd90e1e883238e/header.jpg?t=1765472835","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/789380/1224089/e0d6eff4caefcfde17e9e604b04e93914fe76a2c/1765441046/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765472834","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/789380/1224089/e0d6eff4caefcfde17e9e604b04e93914fe76a2c/1765441046/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765472834","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/789380/1224089/e0d6eff4caefcfde17e9e604b04e93914fe76a2c/1765441046/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765472834","id":257247179,"name":"Sometimes","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257247179/1aa926b4cbe0922068a7